Content: b'{"data":[{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223762393067549"],"id":"1886223762393067549","text":"RT @Vivek4real_: #BITCOIN HASHRATE HITS A NEW ATH \\uD83D\\uDE80 https://t.co/IMxw9nQ4iD"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223761541607900"],"id":"1886223761541607900","text":"RT @Jethroe111: $17,000 Bitcoin\\n\\nLet me tell you a story. \\n\\nIn the last cycle as Bitcoin went from $69k to $20k I had continued to buy occa\xe2\x80\xa6"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223760488861778"],"id":"1886223760488861778","text":"Bitcoin at $100k and altcoins setting new lows\xe2\x80\x94definitely not the altseason I pictured! \\uD83D\\uDE05\\n#\xe5\x81\xa5\xe5\xba\xb7\xe8\xa8\xba\xe6\x96\xad\xe4\xbc\x9a\xe5\xa0\xb4\\n#BLACKPINKxRollingStone\\n#Arsenal\\n#hobi\\n#winwin\\n#Karina\\n#\xe3\x83\xa1\xe3\x83\xab\xe3\x82\xab\xe3\x83\xaa\xe3\x81\xa7\xe8\xa6\x8b\xe3\x81\xa4\xe3\x81\x91\xe3\x81\x9f\xe6\x87\x90\xe3\x81\x8b\xe3\x81\x97\xe3\x81\x84\xe3\x82\x82\xe3\x81\xae https://t.co/ssFNwAXwP8 https://t.co/bKI0JK1i4k"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223759712932010"],"id":"1886223759712932010","text":"RT @techconcatalina: El sentimiento en el Mercado #Cripto es tan malo como cuando #Bitcoin val\xc3\xada 16.000 d\xc3\xb3lares en 2022.\\n\\nEse fue el piso y\xe2\x80\xa6"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223759557738853"],"id":"1886223759557738853","text":"RT @Evecoins: I promised, if #BITCOIN dumps to $97,000 !\\nWe will give $10,000 $BTC to 5 people\\n\\nSo as promised I will be giving away\\n$10,00\xe2\x80\xa6"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223759536758877"],"id":"1886223759536758877","text":"RT @ThePubliusUSA: Bitcoin is plummeting over the weekend. Stock market futures will open up sharply lower.  The cost of living is about to\xe2\x80\xa6"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223758744260899"],"id":"1886223758744260899","text":"#Airdrop #Bitcoin #Binance #Giveaway #Crypto https://t.co/EtCBXjWb00"},{"edit_history_tweet_ids":["1886223758580650194"],"id":"1886223758580650194","text":